# Side navigation icons

Every rail icon must match **Map**: `ModusWcIcon` in `slot="start-icon"`, `size="md"`, `customClass="nav-icon"`, **24×24**. Do not mix custom `<span>` / `<img>` SVGs into the rail unless no Modus glyph exists.

- Token: `--app-sidenav-icon-size: 24px` in `src/index.css`
- Render through `NavIcon` so padding and size stay shared
- Do not set a different `size`, width, height, or start-icon padding per item

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — custom host or a different size than Map
<span slot="start-icon" className="nav-custom-icon" />
<ModusWcIcon decorative name="alert" size="sm" slot="start-icon" />

// ✅ GOOD — same as Map
<ModusWcIcon
  customClass="nav-icon"
  decorative
  name="map"
  size="md"
  slot="start-icon"
/>
```
